[caption id="attachment_5093" align="alignleft" width="300"]<a href="http://davidrobertlewis.files.wordpress.com/2013/05/img_9971.jpg"><img class="size-medium wp-image-5093" alt="IMG_9971" src="http://davidrobertlewis.files.wordpress.com/2013/05/img_9971.jpg?w=300" width="300" height="225" /></a> Canna march past Caledon Square, Cape Town[/caption]

